{"reviewId": "16247623_82c2qvvhL", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "当人力不再是资源，不再是资本时，城市化的意义可能就不会这么重要了。当AI算力取代人力，成为生产资料的同时也是生产力，那么城市人口将是什么样的存在呢？剩余劳动力应该是什么样的存在呢？还需要存在吗？人口还有必要增长吗？没有消耗，生产的意义又是什么呢？", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "7701-7797", "abstract": "我们现在谈论城市化，实际上与我们未来的产业选择有极大的关联性。因为我们把城市化作为本次经济起飞的原动力，所以，未来产业多样化过程中的主导产业将会沿着城市化的线索展开，对这一点，国际经验早有证明", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 7, "reviewId": "16247623_82c2qvvhL", "userVid": 16247623, "topics": [], "createTime": 1754447901, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 7, "chapterTitle": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "author": {"userVid": 16247623, "name": "黄建华", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/lpHDr05YrISgc8icw9ZIibpc8aC00b8ib3YxPdBAibmgcXibQ6FZYNuaBqxII53Y4QKfR2m7gZLVWldQ/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20241028-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 7, "likes": [{"userVid": 16651379, "name": "烽yves", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/VfGeWOq7pWVQjcgTzs5ySoAHh7XFNTIqmfWXibu1ZZgIRxZ6VD984qsPotbs5k6gHT9LycwyBj4k/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240520-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}], "commentsCount": 5, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "我觉得当然不是这样的，虽然AI会代替人类的一些工作，但城市中的人类只要存在就会有需求，虽然生产线上已经与大部分人类无关了，但消费群体依然是城市中的这些人，只是我们不再需要体力劳动去获得报酬，或许是炒股，或许是AI自动帮我们赚钱，总之我们虽然不再是劳动力，但依然是消费主体，所以城市化的意义依然很重要；而且我认为人口增长率越低，人口的增长就反而就会愈加重要，等全世界的人都不需要工作了，大家的生活都依赖人工智能体了，拼的可能就是人口基数了，我们不但要生，还要多生，人口越来越少的国家，可能就会走到灭亡，等到AI过后的下一次技术更新，可能就会是生物，没有人类的支撑，主导者可能就变成了AI，那岂不是倒反天罡，我们成为了AI的宠物？所以我们一定要在数量上增长，让万物为人类所用的前提是有足够的人类。", "reviewId": "16247623_82c2qvvhL", "commentId": "16247623_82c2qvvhL_c560107667_87dwDWmQB", "userVid": 560107667, "createTime": 1772140457, "likesCount": 2, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 560107667, "name": "、lemon🍋", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/KydxAIB52xkqmCsSeDlOOsO5ItR0NSyrT7bdYWNic2bw21GyubmWTFwdBnkms37mMf4XCrvsAGms/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "热爱历史，热爱文学，关注投资理财", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20230918-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}, {"content": "对效率的狂热，人类正在反着走", "reviewId": "16247623_82c2qvvhL", "toCommentId": "16247623_82c2qvvhL_c560107667_87dwDWmQB", "toUserVid": 560107667, "commentId": "16247623_82c2qvvhL_c8607812_889Xk2cmr", "userVid": 8607812, "createTime": 1775459312, "author": {"userVid": 8607812, "name": "一一", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTLzvW5LQAh1LeYHfPumQODew4X13icNrfuVicctrgv7jUcR5QljSz8bWjrn4iarHyJ2cXwbEicicYw4A4Q/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-100", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 100}}, "replyUser": {"userVid": 560107667, "name": "、lemon🍋", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/KydxAIB52xkqmCsSeDlOOsO5ItR0NSyrT7bdYWNic2bw21GyubmWTFwdBnkms37mMf4XCrvsAGms/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "热爱历史，热爱文学，关注投资理财", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M